# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — x86 专属运行时分派内建在 aarch64/OHOS 缺失时，守卫分派宏并复用既有 scalar 回退 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-18
# Software: x86-simd-sort 5.0
# Gate: conan create / 编译（aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos）
# Status: UNMATCHED — 四范围查重无完整覆盖，七轴 combination/boundary/test_migration 新增，
#         已由真实日志验证（90/90 上游 gtest + 7/7 鸿蒙专项 + 消费者用例），待 promote
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-x86-simd-sort-aarch64-scalar-dispatch
severity: 2
category: platform, portability, build-system, simd, ohos
trigger_tool: clang++|meson|conan
phase: compilation
approach: 用 `#if defined(__x86_64__) || defined(__i386__)` 守卫 check_cpu_feature_support
  与 DISPATCH/DISPATCH_KEYVALUE_SORT 的 ISA 选择主体（抽成 XSS_RUNTIME_DISPATCH[_KV]
  辅助宏，非 x86 展开为空），所有入口直接解析到既有 scalar 实现；不移植 NEON、
  不改公开 API、不改 scalar 语义

keywords: x86-simd-sort, __builtin_cpu_supports, __builtin_cpu_init, avx512, avx2,
  scalar fallback, aarch64, OHOS, armv8, dispatch, x86-only SIMD

error_signature: use of undeclared identifier '__builtin_cpu_supports'|use of undeclared identifier '__builtin_cpu_init'|error: use of undeclared identifier
match_keywords: __builtin_cpu_supports,__builtin_cpu_init,use of undeclared identifier,aarch64,avx2,avx512,scalar fallback

root_cause: 上游为 x86-only SIMD 排序库，运行时分派（constructor 函数指针 +
  __builtin_cpu_supports 特性探测）仅面向 x86；__builtin_cpu_init/__builtin_cpu_supports
  为 x86 专属内建，aarch64 clang 15 不存在，导致非 x86 平台连编译都失败；同时
  -march=haswell 等探测为 NO 时 avx2/avx512 目标不构建，if constexpr 分支引用
  未编译 SIMD 符号。库自带完整 scalar 回退（std::sort/nth_element/partial_sort/
  argsort+permute），仅分派入口硬依赖 x86 内建

affected_scope: 任意 x86-only SIMD 编译型库在 OHOS aarch64 落地时，若其运行时分派
  依赖 __builtin_cpu_supports/__builtin_cpu_init 或 x86 march 条件编译，且库内已有
  scalar 回退实现——守卫分派即最小适配；无 scalar 回退或业务必须 SIMD 性能的库不适用

verification: conan-verify G0-G4 PASS；上游 gtest 90/90（48 qsort+36 keyvalue+6 objsort）；
  鸿蒙专项 7/7（scalar 正确性/argsort 置换/qselect/partial_qsort/NAN>INF/keyvalue 配对/
  object_qsort）；test_package 消费者 qsort+argsort ALL CONSUMER CHECKS PASSED

similar_to: DRAFT-jsonifier-neon-cpu-instructions-bits
caused_by: none
prerequisite_of: none
conflicts_with: none
